# Authentication Protection

- Preserve the existing signup and login functionality.
- Do not delete or reset Supabase Auth users.
- Do not modify authentication configuration without approval.
- Preserve existing user IDs and profile relationships.
- Do not delete database tables or user data.
- Before changing authentication-related code, explain the impact.
- Never expose API secrets or user credentials.
- Request explicit approval before destructive operations.
